[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3314152364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110678#issuecomment-3314152364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110678","id":3314152364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FifOs","user":{"login":"KLee1248","id":2625852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjU4NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2625852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248","html_url":"https://github.com/KLee1248","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KLee1248/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T23:17:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T23:17:31Z","body":"I was able to reproduce this issue and I was able to look into it a bit.\n\nI believe this is happening because of an optimization in the CodeEdit class. Specifically, [lines 591-596 in the gui_input function](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3c9d03b8755968ae305b8cfebe886c56402cb044/scene/gui/code_edit.cpp#L591).  \n\nRemoving this code seems to fix the issue, but introduces lag to code completion on deletion.\n\nThe original intent of the code makes the assumption that if we perform a deletion with the backspace key, then we can just re-iterate over the existing code completion options and re-present the options to the user. This seems to fail in the case presented where the user deletes through the \".\"\n\nI'm not sure what the best way to proceed here on how we can fix this but also keep the optimized root for the normal deletion happy path.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3314152364/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3715155976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110678#issuecomment-3715155976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110678","id":3715155976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dcMgI","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T15:34:22Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T15:34:22Z","body":"We should just check the removed character against the completion prefixes and if there is a possibility they somehow match do a full refresh. It's not perfect but probably the best shortterm solution without the necessity to speed up completion.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3715155976/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]